    "state": "{\"description\":\"Planned 2026-10-07. Build order 4 of 7 in the one-graph plan, after the root-cause skill change and the linking fixes F2+F3, and before slice 3, which depends on it. A link record (relation, local node, other design id, other node id, evidence, the far end's fingerprint when linked) written by a relation tool that accepts an id in another design. upstream_status-style checking reports missing or moved far ends. review_relations, link-ideas, the duplicate warning, the ripple and the root-cause neighbours pass read the links.\",\"name\":\"A design records a typed link to a node in another design, and reports when the far end is missing or has moved\",\"provenance\":\"authored\",\"status\":\"realized\"}",
